ExampleUnitTest: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cheroliv/cheroliv.com/blob/master/codes/src/test/kotlin/programming/ConcatFunctionTest.kt&quot;&gt;Quelle&lt;/a&gt;+&lt;/p&gt;
